{"variant": "compliance", "year": 2007, "month": 8, "day": 22, "slug": "legal/settlement-summary-8890", "variant_int": 2, "html": "<section class=\"page-banner\"><div class=\"container\"><p class=\"text-uppercase mb-1\" style=\"color:var(--gold);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.18em;font-size:.75rem\"><a href=\"/archive/\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">Archive</a> &rsaquo; <a href=\"/archive/2007/\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">2007</a> &rsaquo; <a href=\"/archive/2007/08/\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">08</a> &rsaquo; 22</p><p style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);font-size:.72rem;margin-bottom:.4rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase\">Compliance Review &bull; WDR-2007-Q2-1508</p><h1 style=\"font-size:clamp(1.2rem,3vw,2rem);line-height:1.25\">Special Investigation Report — Settlement Summary</h1><p style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:0\">Precision Machining &bull; Cobalt Group &bull; Archived 2007-08-22</p></div></section><section style=\"padding:3rem 0;background:var(--surface)\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row g-4\"><div class=\"col-lg-8\"><div id=\"acpwb-compliance-e8bc3ec1-header\" style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:4px solid var(--gold);padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;margin-bottom:2rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:.5rem\">Document Information</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.3rem .8rem;font-size:.83rem;margin-bottom:.75rem\"><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Client</span><br><strong>Cobalt Group</strong></div><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Industry</span><br><strong>Precision Machining</strong></div><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Audit Ref</span><br><code style=\"font-size:.75rem\">WDR-2007-Q2-1508</code></div><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Version</span><br><code style=\"font-size:.75rem\">2.2</code></div></div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\">Filed by <strong>Shinji Zahavi</strong>, Managing Consultant, Social Sector Workforce &mdash; <a href=\"mailto:shinji.zahavi@acpwb.com\" style=\"color:var(--navy)\">shinji.zahavi@acpwb.com</a></div><div style=\"margin-top:.6rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.3rem\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;padding:.15rem .45rem;background:#f4f6f9;border:1px solid #dde1e8;color:#444\">FCPA §78dd-1 (Foreign Corrupt Practices Act anti-bribery provisions)</span><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;padding:.15rem .45rem;background:#f4f6f9;border:1px solid #dde1e8;color:#444\">Davis-Bacon Act (prevailing wage requirements)</span></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">1. Engagement Scope</h5><p style=\"font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333\">The scope of this engagement encompasses a systematic evaluation of Cobalt Group&#x27;s compensation administration practices against regulatory benchmarks established under applicable law. Field work was conducted between 2007-08-22 and 2007-10-28, with data collection spanning 54 employee records across 24 reporting units in the Precision Machining sector.</p></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">2. Methodology</h5><p style=\"font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333\">The review of Cobalt Group&#x27;s I-9 compliance included a re-verification of a sample of 54 forms using the E-Verify system and a review of internal audit procedures for form completion and retention.</p></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">3. Findings Summary</h5><div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><table class=\"dash-table w-100\"><thead><tr><th>Finding ID</th><th>Risk</th><th>Status</th><th>Owner</th><th>Due</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">WDR-3325-001</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef9c3;color:#854d0e;border:1px solid #fde047\">LOW</span></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">DEFERRED</span></td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem\">Director of Content Strategy</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">2007-12-28</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;max-width:240px\">Summary Plan Descriptions (SPDs) for 54 benefit plans have not been updated to reflect recent plan amendments</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">WDR-5880-002</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef9c3;color:#854d0e;border:1px solid #fde047\">LOW</span></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;border:1px solid #fcd34d\">IN PROGRESS</span></td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem\">Senior Manager of Policy Analysis</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">2007-12-28</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;max-width:240px\">Golden parachute payment calculations for 54 executives do not align with §280G regulations</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">WDR-2122-003</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;border:1px solid #fcd34d\">MEDIUM</span></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fee2e2;color:#991b1b;border:1px solid #fca5a5\">OPEN</span></td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem\">Director of Brand Marketing</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">2007-11-28</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;max-width:240px\">Proxy statement CD&amp;A omits required discussion of FCPA §78dd-1 (Foreign Corrupt Practices Act anti-bribery provisions); Davis-Bacon Act (prevailing wage requirements) performance metrics</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">WDR-8281-004</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">INFO</span></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">DEFERRED</span></td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem\">Risk Analyst</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">2007-12-28</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;max-width:240px\">Union information requests for bargaining unit data were not fulfilled within the required timeframe</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">4. Detailed Findings</h5><div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:1rem;padding:1rem 1.2rem\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;margin-bottom:.55rem\"><code style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">WDR-3325-001</code><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef9c3;color:#854d0e;border:1px solid #fde047\">LOW</span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Observation</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">Summary Plan Descriptions (SPDs) for 54 benefit plans have not been updated to reflect recent plan amendments</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Corrective Action Required</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">A standardized process will be implemented to respond to all formal union information requests within 10 business days, with all responses reviewed by labor relations counsel.</p></div><div style=\"padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Management Response</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:.4rem\">The finding is acknowledged. This issue was caused by a temporary system outage on 2007-08-22. The system has been restored, and the backlog of affected transactions has been cleared. We consider this matter closed.</p><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">Owner: <strong>Director of Content Strategy</strong> &bull; Due: <strong>2007-12-28</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:1rem;padding:1rem 1.2rem\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;margin-bottom:.55rem\"><code style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">WDR-5880-002</code><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef9c3;color:#854d0e;border:1px solid #fde047\">LOW</span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Observation</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">Golden parachute payment calculations for 54 executives do not align with §280G regulations</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Corrective Action Required</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The annual open enrollment communications package will be updated to include the most current HIPAA privacy notice as a mandatory acknowledgment item for all enrolling employees.</p></div><div style=\"padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Management Response</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:.4rem\">This finding relates to a legacy system that is scheduled for decommissioning on 2007-08-22. Given the impending system retirement, management has accepted the risk for the interim period and will not invest in remediation for the legacy system.</p><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">Owner: <strong>Senior Manager of Policy Analysis</strong> &bull; Due: <strong>2007-12-28</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:1rem;padding:1rem 1.2rem\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;margin-bottom:.55rem\"><code style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">WDR-2122-003</code><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;border:1px solid #fcd34d\">MEDIUM</span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Observation</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">Proxy statement CD&amp;A omits required discussion of FCPA §78dd-1 (Foreign Corrupt Practices Act anti-bribery provisions); Davis-Bacon Act (prevailing wage requirements) performance metrics</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Corrective Action Required</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">Revise the reduction-in-force (RIF) checklist to include a multi-level legal review of WARN Act notification triggers and timelines prior to any future mass layoff event.</p></div><div style=\"padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Management Response</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:.4rem\">The condition identified has been partially remediated. Cobalt Group has addressed the majority of the affected population and is on track for full closure by the due date. A status update will be provided at the next scheduled review.</p><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">Owner: <strong>Director of Brand Marketing</strong> &bull; Due: <strong>2007-11-28</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:1rem;padding:1rem 1.2rem\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;margin-bottom:.55rem\"><code style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">WDR-8281-004</code><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">INFORMATIONAL</span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Observation</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">Union information requests for bargaining unit data were not fulfilled within the required timeframe</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Corrective Action Required</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The HRIS will be audited and reconfigured to ensure FMLA leave entitlement calculations are 100% compliant with the &quot;rolling 12-month period measured backward&quot; method.</p></div><div style=\"padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Management Response</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Management accepts the finding. The relevant system configuration has been updated, and the change will be deployed to production during the next scheduled release on 2007-08-22.</p><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">Owner: <strong>Risk Analyst</strong> &bull; Due: <strong>2007-12-28</strong></div></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:1.5rem;padding-top:1.25rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;justify-content:space-between\"><a href=\"/archive/2007/08/21/workplace-strategy-and-return-to-office-utilization-data-5452/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\">&larr; Previous</a><a href=\"/archive/2007/08/22/legal/settlement-summary-8890/performance-management-calibration-results-7612/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\">Next &rarr;</a></div></div><div class=\"col-lg-4 d-none d-lg-block\"><div style=\"position:sticky;top:2rem\"><div class=\"acpwb-card mb-3\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:.7rem\">Audit Record</div><dl class=\"mb-0\" style=\"font-size:.82rem\"><dt style=\"opacity:.55;font-size:.68rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em\">Audit Ref</dt><dd class=\"mb-2\" style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:.75rem;opacity:.7\">WDR-2007-Q2-1508</dd><dt style=\"opacity:.55;font-size:.68rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em\">Date</dt><dd class=\"fw-700 mb-2\">2007-08-22</dd><dt style=\"opacity:.55;font-size:.68rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em\">Organization</dt><dd class=\"fw-700 mb-2\">Cobalt Group</dd><dt style=\"opacity:.55;font-size:.68rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em\">Findings</dt><dd class=\"mb-2\">4 total</dd><dt style=\"opacity:.55;font-size:.68rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em\">Record ID</dt><dd class=\"mb-0\" style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:.75rem;opacity:.7\">e8bc3ec1</dd></dl></div><div class=\"acpwb-card mb-3\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:.7rem\">Navigation</div><ul class=\"list-unstyled mb-0\" style=\"font-size:.82rem\"><li class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"/archive/2007/\" style=\"color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\">&larr; All 2007 Records</a></li><li class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"/archive/2007/08/\" style=\"color:inherit;opacity:.7;text-decoration:none\">&larr; 2007/08</a></li><li class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"/archive/2007/08/21/workplace-strategy-and-return-to-office-utilization-data-5452/\" style=\"color:inherit;opacity:.55;text-decoration:none\">&larr; Previous Entry</a></li><li class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"/archive/2007/08/22/le